1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:05,800
ARG Merchant Quest — a real-world ARG for independent shops,
built on Solana Devnet and MagicBlock Ephemeral Rollups.

2
00:00:06,200 --> 00:00:13,500
Players discover merchant-approved trails.
The reward is fixed: no races, no speed bonus.

3
00:00:13,700 --> 00:00:21,800
Everything simulated — coupons, products, staff handoffs —
is labelled as a demo in the app.

4
00:00:22,200 --> 00:00:33,000
Merchant studio (password-protected). The Story Lab drafts
three campaign concepts from the shop's own facts.

5
00:00:33,200 --> 00:00:44,500
No AI key in this recording, so the Lab labels itself 'Local draft
assistant'. Our recorded live run used Claude Opus 5.5.

6
00:00:44,700 --> 00:00:55,800
'Use this concept' fills an editable draft.
Nothing is published until an operator approves it.

7
00:00:56,200 --> 00:01:05,500
Player on a phone: The Ninth Cup.
The objective and the story come first.

8
00:01:05,700 --> 00:01:15,500
Public clues open one at a time;
the in-store clues unlock at the counter.

9
00:01:15,700 --> 00:01:25,800
The counter answer is checked on the server.
Next, a person reviews the player's photo.

10
00:01:26,200 --> 00:01:33,500
Mara, the investigation companion,
sees only what this player has unlocked.

11
00:01:33,700 --> 00:01:40,800
Without an AI key she runs as the labelled scripted guide —
and still refuses to give the answer.

12
00:01:41,200 --> 00:01:48,800
In production Mara runs on Claude Opus 5.5.
These figures come from the recorded live run.

13
00:01:49,200 --> 00:01:59,000
The server reads the campaign's clue milestone live from the
MagicBlock Ephemeral Rollup: ER live 3 · Solana committed 3.

14
00:01:59,200 --> 00:02:08,500
At 2+ eligible handoffs a prewritten shared story record unlocks
for Mara — labelled as story text, not player data.

15
00:02:08,700 --> 00:02:18,800
The app verifies an ER transaction directly on the rollup:
the fixture's clue counter moving from 1 to 2.

16
00:02:19,200 --> 00:02:28,800
Recorded live Claude replies before and after that transition:
locked at 1 handoff, unlocked at 2.

17
00:02:29,200 --> 00:02:38,800
A verified completion pays a fixed 1.00 tUSDC on Solana Devnet
(valueless demo token) — read live from RPC for this video.

18
00:02:39,200 --> 00:02:47,800
Next: visits fund the intelligence through MagicBlock-native payments —
experimental, blocked at deposit settlement, not in this release.

